### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Inspect the latest HTTP probe result, readiness and authentication configuration. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Registry restart, wrong URL, authentication failure or unavailable storage.

### Fix
Restore endpoint access and registry readiness; use the configured credentials.

### Verify
The next observed probe reports a successful 2xx response. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
